WEBVTT
00:00:00.010 --> 00:00:10.010
[ Watch on kissFlix.co ]

00:00:07.632 --> 00:00:09.926
His Majesty, the king, has arrived!

00:01:27.712 --> 00:01:31.216
From this day on,
I will no longer worry about you.

00:01:32.258 --> 00:01:33.259
Instead,

00:01:33.885 --> 00:01:37.806
I will satisfy myself
with wishing you the best for the future.

00:01:39.390 --> 00:01:40.642
If you will allow,

00:01:40.725 --> 00:01:44.145
I want to take that wish
and place it in my flower.

00:01:44.729 --> 00:01:46.731
For now, it is entrusted to you.

00:03:21.242 --> 00:03:23.119
In the initial examination,

00:03:23.203 --> 00:03:28.124
I asked in what ways the sacred herb
tobacco most becomes a loyal subject.

00:03:28.208 --> 00:03:29.500
Out of many answers,

00:03:29.584 --> 00:03:33.713
a certain man most commendably
expounded upon The Analects' teachings

00:03:33.796 --> 00:03:36.507
that we be slow in speech
and swift in action.

00:03:46.517 --> 00:03:49.395
This is that man's paper
from the palace examination.

00:03:49.479 --> 00:03:52.440
I asked, "When a new branch
is born of an old tree,

00:03:52.523 --> 00:03:55.235
what should it throw away,
what should it preserve,

00:03:55.318 --> 00:03:57.570
and in what direction should it grow?"

00:03:57.654 --> 00:04:02.075
Any fool could see this was a metaphor
for my current situation.

00:04:03.660 --> 00:04:04.661
Well then,

00:04:05.411 --> 00:04:07.163
what did he give for an answer?

00:04:10.333 --> 00:04:12.752
In a place where
solemn scholarship is discussed,

00:04:12.835 --> 00:04:16.506
he dared to criticize
the neglect of fact-based inquiry.

00:04:17.423 --> 00:04:20.301
N… No, your grace.
That's not what I meant.

00:04:20.385 --> 00:04:22.512
You wrote, "He who fears
to prune old branches

00:04:22.595 --> 00:04:25.223
will risk endangering
the life of the entire tree."

00:04:25.306 --> 00:04:26.474
Did you not?

00:04:28.226 --> 00:04:31.479
Not only that, you rendered
this thought in frivolous prose!

00:04:36.693 --> 00:04:40.154
This is water spilled on white porcelain,

00:04:40.238 --> 00:04:43.157
it will quickly dry up and leave no trace.

00:04:44.575 --> 00:04:46.327
This, however, is ink.

00:04:47.620 --> 00:04:49.747
It will not come off so easily.

00:04:51.958 --> 00:04:53.501
And he who spills it is stained.

00:04:56.379 --> 00:04:57.755
Do you understand?

00:04:58.715 --> 00:05:02.844
Now, whether the stain of these careless
words was made in water or in ink,

00:05:02.927 --> 00:05:05.179
I shall have to keep a close eye on you.

00:05:06.639 --> 00:05:07.765
Yes, your grace.

00:05:21.321 --> 00:05:22.322
Follow me.

00:05:25.742 --> 00:05:26.826
Hmm.

00:05:32.540 --> 00:05:34.167
Well, my chief Eunuch,

00:05:34.250 --> 00:05:37.962
do you surmise why,
despite this man's vulgar scribbles,

00:05:38.671 --> 00:05:40.548
I elected to spare his life?

00:05:43.509 --> 00:05:47.305
The manner in which he expresses
his thought may indeed be vile,

00:05:48.014 --> 00:05:50.350
but he does not have the skill
to deceive me.

00:05:52.226 --> 00:05:54.979
A king's life
must touch upon the entire world,

00:05:55.646 --> 00:05:58.524
and keeping this piece of it close
will be useful.

00:06:02.945 --> 00:06:05.239
He is not to be cast aside hastily.

00:06:18.044 --> 00:06:20.713
Even if she is able to read
the vernacular script,

00:06:20.797 --> 00:06:23.091
I worry Elementary Learning
may prove a bit…

00:06:23.966 --> 00:06:26.135
If reading it is no trouble,

00:06:26.219 --> 00:06:28.721
then understanding it
will be no trouble either.

00:06:29.555 --> 00:06:31.432
You are right. That is true.

00:06:33.101 --> 00:06:35.937
But she says
she has never properly studied before.

00:06:36.020 --> 00:06:38.564
I worry it will prove
to be too challenging for her.

00:06:38.648 --> 00:06:40.149
Concubine or not,

00:06:40.233 --> 00:06:42.193
she is a member of this family.

00:06:42.276 --> 00:06:45.113
That membership comes with responsibility.

00:06:46.197 --> 00:06:47.240
At the very least,

00:06:47.323 --> 00:06:51.619
she must cultivate the discipline to learn
by heart the propriety expected of her.

00:06:51.702 --> 00:06:52.995
And so, until she does,

00:06:53.079 --> 00:06:55.957
she will be looked down upon
wherever she goes.

00:06:56.040 --> 00:06:57.083
That is true.

00:06:57.583 --> 00:07:00.420
Well, we can't have people gossiping,
I suppose,

00:07:00.962 --> 00:07:02.713
or claiming our concubine is ignorant.

00:07:02.797 --> 00:07:03.798
Agreed.

00:07:04.424 --> 00:07:06.926
Please entrust the matter to me,
my lord husband.

00:07:13.141 --> 00:07:14.851
Though it may seem severe,

00:07:15.351 --> 00:07:18.187
please remember that all of this
is for your own good.

00:07:19.147 --> 00:07:21.441
Read the introduction
to Confucian learning,

00:07:21.524 --> 00:07:23.526
and copy it 100 times.

00:07:23.609 --> 00:07:25.903
100 times?

00:07:45.256 --> 00:07:46.466
Young madam?

00:07:47.300 --> 00:07:49.594
Young madam, are you asleep?

00:07:51.929 --> 00:07:53.181
"Young madam"?

00:07:59.103 --> 00:08:00.563
A letter for you.

00:08:03.816 --> 00:08:04.859
A letter?

00:08:09.739 --> 00:08:12.909
I apologize for breaking
your alarm clock earlier today.

00:08:13.659 --> 00:08:14.827
I am most dismayed,

00:08:14.911 --> 00:08:18.164
as I have unintentionally
damaged something precious of yours.

00:08:19.165 --> 00:08:21.375
I sincerely beg your pardon.

00:08:22.710 --> 00:08:25.463
How could I possibly make amends
for such a mistake?

00:08:26.088 --> 00:08:29.467
Uh, I am Kwon In-ho,
youngest son of the Left State Councilor.

00:08:29.550 --> 00:08:31.677
-My house is across from yours.
-In-ho?

00:08:33.387 --> 00:08:35.223
You could pay me back for it.

00:09:31.445 --> 00:09:36.033
Steady does it. Halt. And down.

00:10:07.356 --> 00:10:09.191
So she's Catholic.

00:10:14.530 --> 00:10:15.990
-Amen.
-Amen.

00:10:55.196 --> 00:10:57.907
My cousin feared
you'd be out alone at this late hour,

00:10:58.407 --> 00:11:01.035
but she felt a palanquin excessive.

00:11:01.994 --> 00:11:04.288
She requested that I come instead,

00:11:04.372 --> 00:11:07.625
as your journey back home
can be quite dangerous from here.

00:11:10.753 --> 00:11:13.923
I am familiar with this household
and its activities.

00:11:14.423 --> 00:11:17.343
All the more reason to escort you home.

00:11:33.109 --> 00:11:34.985
When I was still a young boy,

00:11:35.486 --> 00:11:39.657
my mother would always give me dried
mugwort leaves around this time of year.

00:11:39.740 --> 00:11:44.328
They repel the troublesome mosquitoes that
come down from the mountain as it warms.

00:11:46.539 --> 00:11:50.501
She feared that her only son's face
might be blemished by mosquito bites.

00:11:54.922 --> 00:11:56.215
Here. Take it.

00:11:57.925 --> 00:12:00.428
Dried mugwort leaves for the walk back.

00:12:01.971 --> 00:12:04.932
If a mosquito bite
were to appear on your face,

00:12:05.558 --> 00:12:07.435
would it not arouse suspicion
in your house?

00:12:07.518 --> 00:12:09.311
I'm all right, my lord.

00:12:10.020 --> 00:12:12.356
But it is not all right, is it?

00:12:14.692 --> 00:12:17.445
If suspicions are aroused,
then your activities will be discovered,

00:12:17.528 --> 00:12:19.155
and if that happens, not only I,

00:12:19.238 --> 00:12:21.657
but everyone who gathered here
will be harmed.

00:12:22.324 --> 00:12:23.743
So I ask you again,

00:12:24.326 --> 00:12:25.745
would that be all right?

00:12:27.204 --> 00:12:28.205
Hmm?

00:12:35.463 --> 00:12:36.505
Go on, take it.

00:12:45.473 --> 00:12:46.515
Madam.

00:12:48.100 --> 00:12:49.894
The palanquin has just returned home.

00:12:51.020 --> 00:12:52.813
And the councilor's daughter-in-law?

00:12:52.897 --> 00:12:54.690
She returned home, I trust?

00:12:54.774 --> 00:12:56.650
Actually, no. It returned empty.

00:12:56.734 --> 00:12:59.695
They said that Lord Cho came out
and sent the palanquin back to us.

00:12:59.779 --> 00:13:01.030
He should not have done that!

00:13:01.989 --> 00:13:03.491
Go and have it sent back.

00:13:06.827 --> 00:13:08.913
Go instruct them
to wait at the district entrance.

00:13:09.413 --> 00:13:12.458
When she arrives, make sure
she goes the rest of the way hidden.

00:13:17.421 --> 00:13:19.590
-Gye-hwa.
-Yes, ma'am.

00:13:19.673 --> 00:13:21.926
The widow can't be seen with Cho Won.

00:13:22.009 --> 00:13:24.595
If anyone so much as catches a glimpse
of them together,

00:13:25.095 --> 00:13:27.807
the gossip in Bukchon
will go on without end.

00:13:28.933 --> 00:13:30.017
You're right, madam.

00:13:32.311 --> 00:13:34.855
What of the Left State Councilor
and Lady of the First Rank?

00:13:34.939 --> 00:13:36.857
Has either of them yet returned?

00:13:36.941 --> 00:13:38.108
No, ma'am.

00:13:38.192 --> 00:13:39.443
Then go with all haste.

00:14:09.473 --> 00:14:10.474
Careful.

00:14:11.183 --> 00:14:13.435
The road is riddled with loose stones.

00:14:14.144 --> 00:14:16.605
If you stumble and fall,
I will not be able to catch you.

00:14:16.689 --> 00:14:18.691
So, please, watch close.

00:14:19.650 --> 00:14:21.652
I will show you which way is safe.

00:14:51.849 --> 00:14:53.100
Please, go on ahead.

00:14:53.809 --> 00:14:55.644
I shall rest here a moment longer.

00:14:56.645 --> 00:14:57.646
Ah.

00:14:58.355 --> 00:15:00.900
Oh, no. Forgive me.

00:15:01.609 --> 00:15:03.694
I had only considered my own pace.

00:15:03.777 --> 00:15:05.404
As you wish,

00:15:05.905 --> 00:15:07.698
we'll rest before we go on.

00:15:21.170 --> 00:15:22.212
Tell me,

00:15:23.756 --> 00:15:26.216
why do you yet live, my lady?

00:15:28.010 --> 00:15:29.762
Had you taken your own life,

00:15:30.804 --> 00:15:33.807
all the kingdom would have wept
at your virtue.

00:15:40.481 --> 00:15:42.149
My mother-in-law is ill.

00:15:43.609 --> 00:15:46.070
The household cannot spare another woman.

00:15:46.946 --> 00:15:49.073
And with a new heir yet to be adopted,

00:15:49.156 --> 00:15:50.824
I thought best to delay.

00:15:50.908 --> 00:15:52.868
But now,
my mother-in-law's health improves,

00:15:52.952 --> 00:15:54.787
and I will soon
be able to follow my husband.

00:15:57.998 --> 00:15:59.124
Well then,

00:16:00.584 --> 00:16:02.044
this is goodbye, eh?

00:16:04.713 --> 00:16:06.048
I'm sorry, it's just…

00:16:09.343 --> 00:16:11.553
You would not be able to do such a thing.

00:16:12.137 --> 00:16:15.808
Especially if you're aware
of the Lord's teaching to cherish life.

00:16:18.519 --> 00:16:22.064
I am aware of the teachings of the Lord.

00:16:22.147 --> 00:16:24.566
It's not as strange as you might suppose.

00:16:25.150 --> 00:16:28.654
I have always had a great interest
in various fields of knowledge.

00:16:28.737 --> 00:16:32.157
Naturally, I've come across it
in my study of Western learning.

00:16:33.826 --> 00:16:35.369
Hold, hold, hold, hold, hold.

00:16:37.538 --> 00:16:38.539
My lord.

00:16:39.456 --> 00:16:42.084
Lady Cho has ordered us
to carry the widow back.

00:16:45.879 --> 00:16:47.006
Did she?

00:16:53.929 --> 00:16:57.141
Heave ho. Onward.

00:17:56.867 --> 00:17:59.870
Madam, the palanquin has returned safely.

00:18:06.418 --> 00:18:08.337
My lady.

00:18:08.420 --> 00:18:10.464
-Whoa, whoa, whoa.
-My lady.

00:18:10.547 --> 00:18:11.590
Eun-sil.

00:18:12.216 --> 00:18:13.217
Right this way.

00:18:23.143 --> 00:18:24.937
Halt. Down.

00:19:06.395 --> 00:19:08.313
INTRODUCTION TO
ESSENTIAL CATHOLIC TEACHINGS

00:19:13.026 --> 00:19:16.029
"Thou shalt not kill."

00:19:19.783 --> 00:19:21.702
"Thou shalt not kill."

00:19:21.785 --> 00:19:23.120
"Thou shalt not kill."

00:20:00.616 --> 00:20:06.622
I thought it was a spring day

00:20:18.508 --> 00:20:23.597
I thought I would ride
A flower palanquin

00:20:24.348 --> 00:20:29.353
Following my groom

00:20:30.020 --> 00:20:33.899
On a swift horse

00:20:35.901 --> 00:20:41.406
And walk the path

00:20:41.490 --> 00:20:47.746
Of a woman

00:20:51.583 --> 00:20:55.671
But you did not come

00:20:55.754 --> 00:21:00.092
Only a plain palanquin
Covered in cotton cloth

00:21:00.717 --> 00:21:04.346
Was there alone

00:21:17.859 --> 00:21:24.366
I thought it was a spring day

00:22:40.609 --> 00:22:43.236
Won, are you nervous?

00:22:47.824 --> 00:22:48.950
Dear cousin.

00:23:19.815 --> 00:23:20.816
Madam.

00:23:22.234 --> 00:23:25.404
If you cannot sleep,
shall I bring you some tea?

00:23:26.822 --> 00:23:28.907
Forgive me for causing you any worry.

00:23:29.866 --> 00:23:30.951
I am all right.

00:23:31.034 --> 00:23:32.244
You may retire.

00:23:49.386 --> 00:23:53.390
How can she expect me
to write this 100 times?

00:23:55.142 --> 00:23:57.686
It was the young master
who caused the commotion.

00:23:58.478 --> 00:24:00.397
Why is she doing this to me?

00:24:17.038 --> 00:24:18.039
Huh.

00:24:57.496 --> 00:24:58.830
I am most grateful

00:24:58.914 --> 00:25:01.708
that Your Lordship
would offer me an apology.

00:25:02.667 --> 00:25:05.837
But you need not worry anymore
about the broken clock.

00:25:05.921 --> 00:25:08.006
It is of no grave matter to me.

00:25:09.216 --> 00:25:11.885
However, to tell it true,

00:25:11.968 --> 00:25:15.388
my hand was slashed
upon the pieces of broken glass.

00:25:16.223 --> 00:25:18.016
I had promised the elders of the family

00:25:18.099 --> 00:25:21.770
to read the annotated vernacular edition
of Elementary Learning and study it

00:25:21.853 --> 00:25:22.854
while copying down

00:25:22.938 --> 00:25:26.358
the chapter on introduction
to Confucian learning 100 times.

00:25:26.983 --> 00:25:30.654
But now I am unable to do so,
which is a pity.

00:25:31.613 --> 00:25:34.157
I'm sure you are well aware, young master,

00:25:34.241 --> 00:25:39.621
that a promise is a matter of great trust
between one member of a clan and another.

00:25:39.704 --> 00:25:40.747
That book…

00:25:41.248 --> 00:25:42.749
I have my copy somewhere.

00:25:43.416 --> 00:25:47.921
It pains me to say,
but I fear I will now lose their trust.

00:25:55.136 --> 00:25:56.137
Sixty-two.

00:25:57.180 --> 00:25:58.181
Sixty-three.

00:25:58.265 --> 00:26:00.183
I only wish I had brought them sooner.

00:26:01.601 --> 00:26:03.395
I was glad to reread Elementary Learning.

00:26:03.478 --> 00:26:05.355
For that, I have you to thank.

00:26:05.855 --> 00:26:06.856
Sixty-five.

00:26:07.440 --> 00:26:08.441
Sixty-seven.

00:26:08.525 --> 00:26:10.277
I studied Elementary Learning
with my older brother.

00:26:10.360 --> 00:26:11.361
Sixty-eight.

00:26:11.444 --> 00:26:13.280
I was only five years old at the time.

00:26:13.363 --> 00:26:15.532
He was like a teacher to me.

00:26:15.615 --> 00:26:16.616
Seventy.

00:26:17.117 --> 00:26:18.159
-Seventy-one.
-Indeed,

00:26:18.243 --> 00:26:20.912
it is hard to believe
it has already been twenty…

00:26:20.996 --> 00:26:22.455
-Twenty.
-…seven months.

00:26:22.539 --> 00:26:25.083
-Twenty-seven.
-Or twenty-eight months.

00:26:25.166 --> 00:26:27.252
-Twenty-eight. Twenty-nine.
-No, wait.

00:26:27.335 --> 00:26:28.336
Twenty-six months.

00:26:28.420 --> 00:26:29.629
Thirty.

00:26:29.713 --> 00:26:31.798
Uh. Thirty?

00:26:33.717 --> 00:26:34.968
-Anyway…
-Damn him.

00:26:35.051 --> 00:26:37.470
-This year, the mourning period will end…
-I'll start again.

00:26:37.554 --> 00:26:39.264
-…so I had decided to visit him.
-One.

00:26:39.931 --> 00:26:41.057
Two.

00:26:41.141 --> 00:26:43.310
Each step I took, one by one…

00:26:43.393 --> 00:26:45.729
-One.
-…filled my heart with profound sorrow.

00:26:45.812 --> 00:26:46.896
Hang on.

00:26:47.439 --> 00:26:50.525
Did you do this on purpose or what?

00:26:51.109 --> 00:26:55.447
Elementary Learning allows me to reminisce
of the times I spent with him.

00:26:56.323 --> 00:26:57.907
In a most tender--

00:26:57.991 --> 00:26:58.992
Uh…

00:27:00.410 --> 00:27:01.703
My sincerest thanks.

00:27:02.329 --> 00:27:05.206
But it seems there's a page missing.

00:27:06.249 --> 00:27:07.626
I counted 99.

00:27:11.796 --> 00:27:14.090
But I made sure there were 100.

00:27:14.674 --> 00:27:17.969
It would appear not.
And I counted them over twice.

00:27:21.681 --> 00:27:24.434
Would you make one more?

00:27:25.518 --> 00:27:26.645
I would thank you.

00:27:29.230 --> 00:27:30.231
Of course.

00:27:37.113 --> 00:27:38.198
Yes, my lady.

00:27:39.324 --> 00:27:41.284
I shall do it at once.

00:28:36.005 --> 00:28:38.216
Um, here.

00:28:44.389 --> 00:28:45.807
Oh.

00:28:47.892 --> 00:28:50.019
Young Master In-ho. My thanks.

00:28:51.020 --> 00:28:52.647
Oh, of course.

00:28:56.526 --> 00:29:00.155
May I ask you what your name is, my lady?

00:29:00.739 --> 00:29:01.781
Ah.

00:29:04.617 --> 00:29:05.660
Yes, it's

00:29:06.619 --> 00:29:07.746
So-ok.

00:29:08.663 --> 00:29:10.039
My name is So-ok.

00:29:11.124 --> 00:29:13.084
Ah. So-ok.

00:29:14.502 --> 00:29:16.963
It is truly a most fitting name.

00:29:17.672 --> 00:29:19.507
So-ok.

00:29:20.759 --> 00:29:24.012
May I inquire, So-ok,
as to what brings you here,

00:29:24.095 --> 00:29:25.138
to His Lordship's house?

00:29:25.221 --> 00:29:27.265
Me? Uh…

00:29:27.807 --> 00:29:30.018
Well, it's just I, uh…

00:29:30.101 --> 00:29:31.102
-I mean--
-You see--

00:29:31.186 --> 00:29:35.064
Are you by any chance,
the niece of Lady Cho who visited before?

00:29:36.191 --> 00:29:38.318
I remember my mother telling me about you.

00:29:40.069 --> 00:29:43.990
Then, you must be related
to Master Cho Won as well, no?

00:29:44.574 --> 00:29:47.786
Yes, uh, so I am.

00:29:49.287 --> 00:29:52.749
Oh, well, I'm afraid
I must head back inside.

00:29:53.333 --> 00:29:54.584
-Wait.
-Oh.

00:29:59.589 --> 00:30:02.801
I… I would keep you for one thing further.

00:30:08.431 --> 00:30:12.894
Uh, I brought this from my house
without my mother knowing.

00:30:12.977 --> 00:30:15.522
You said you cut your hand on the clock.

00:30:16.272 --> 00:30:17.273
Ah…

00:30:17.899 --> 00:30:22.862
If you gather some like this
and apply it to the cut,

00:30:22.946 --> 00:30:24.656
it should be healed in no time.

00:30:26.199 --> 00:30:27.742
You were hurt because of me,

00:30:28.409 --> 00:30:29.828
so I must bring the remedy,

00:30:29.911 --> 00:30:31.621
-should I not?
-Mm-hmm.

00:30:40.755 --> 00:30:42.757
I will borrow it, only for three…

00:30:43.341 --> 00:30:45.385
No. For only two days.

00:30:46.594 --> 00:30:47.971
Two days from right now,

00:30:48.054 --> 00:30:52.392
when the two hands of the alarm clock
stretch out flat like the horizon,

00:30:53.476 --> 00:30:55.562
let us meet here again.

00:30:57.814 --> 00:31:00.024
Uh… Yes.

00:31:00.108 --> 00:31:01.109
Good night.

00:31:15.748 --> 00:31:17.417
Mind your step.

00:31:27.886 --> 00:31:29.429
When the two alarm clocks… No.

00:31:29.512 --> 00:31:31.723
When the hands of the alarm clock
stretch flat…

00:32:14.641 --> 00:32:16.100
Let me see here.

00:32:16.601 --> 00:32:21.731
Now, how long has it been
since we last drank together?

00:32:21.814 --> 00:32:22.815
Hmm?

00:32:23.608 --> 00:32:24.817
Oh, yes.

00:32:24.901 --> 00:32:28.071
Is it not the first time
since we drank when I was at Hwaseong?

00:32:28.154 --> 00:32:30.114
Yes, that's correct.

00:32:31.574 --> 00:32:34.077
You were there
for the relocation of the royal tomb.

00:32:34.160 --> 00:32:35.244
Hmm.

00:32:37.622 --> 00:32:40.625
You know, I must say,

00:32:41.376 --> 00:32:44.545
I found myself quite unable to comprehend.

00:32:44.629 --> 00:32:45.964
Comprehend what?

00:32:46.047 --> 00:32:48.549
The king cherished his son.

00:32:51.094 --> 00:32:54.013
To seal his cherished son
in a mere rice chest,

00:32:54.097 --> 00:32:55.723
that I cannot comprehend.

00:32:55.807 --> 00:32:57.100
He's a father.

00:32:57.183 --> 00:33:00.019
How could he do that
to his precious child?

00:33:00.103 --> 00:33:03.064
-I can't speak for the father…
-Hmm.

00:33:03.147 --> 00:33:07.527
…but I think I can understand the heart
of the son who longed to defy him.

00:33:10.321 --> 00:33:12.573
Until the day he was sealed away.

00:33:13.992 --> 00:33:15.243
To a son,

00:33:15.868 --> 00:33:19.580
a father can be a world
he can never reconcile with.

00:33:19.664 --> 00:33:23.543
Indeed. Mmm. You speak it true.

00:33:45.523 --> 00:33:47.233
It would seem the prince…

00:33:49.736 --> 00:33:51.404
was much like myself.

00:33:56.034 --> 00:33:57.035
Two men…

00:34:01.289 --> 00:34:04.167
defeated before
the dreaded name of "father."

00:34:27.648 --> 00:34:29.233
Make sure it is clear.

00:34:29.734 --> 00:34:31.944
That's how my dear cousin
prefers his broth.

00:34:32.028 --> 00:34:33.196
Yes, madam.

00:35:00.723 --> 00:35:03.184
If I ever imbibe so much again,

00:35:03.726 --> 00:35:06.062
I will be changing my family's name
to Cho.

00:35:07.230 --> 00:35:10.358
I would not do so myself,
that name has made you Minister.

00:35:12.360 --> 00:35:13.569
Oh, my head.

00:35:13.653 --> 00:35:16.489
Why did you not stop me?

00:35:16.572 --> 00:35:19.534
My lord! My lord! My lord!

00:35:19.617 --> 00:35:22.620
There's a herald out front!
A herald from the palace wishes to enter!

00:35:22.703 --> 00:35:25.873
-A herald? From the palace, you said?
-Yes, my lord.

00:35:26.457 --> 00:35:28.668
I thought the king was upset with me.

00:35:28.751 --> 00:35:30.336
I thought I was to be dismissed.

00:35:30.419 --> 00:35:31.754
Have I not always advised you

00:35:31.838 --> 00:35:34.757
not to worry over things
that lie outside your control?

00:35:34.841 --> 00:35:36.342
It is just as I thought.

00:35:36.425 --> 00:35:38.469
His Majesty knows your true heart.

00:35:39.554 --> 00:35:40.763
You really think so?

00:35:42.598 --> 00:35:45.476
Oh. Go now. He is here.

00:35:45.560 --> 00:35:46.561
Yes, yes.

00:35:46.644 --> 00:35:48.646
Goodness. I should not be sitting.

00:35:48.729 --> 00:35:50.106
My word.

00:35:56.696 --> 00:35:59.407
I am prepared. Recite it at once.

00:36:00.867 --> 00:36:02.869
-My lord, I--
-Come and recite.

00:36:02.952 --> 00:36:04.662
Has His Majesty not summoned me?

00:36:04.745 --> 00:36:05.955
There's not a moment to lose.

00:36:06.622 --> 00:36:07.832
That is not so.

00:36:09.750 --> 00:36:10.918
His Majesty

00:36:11.502 --> 00:36:13.754
has summoned a man named Cho Won.

00:36:19.468 --> 00:36:21.679
Then, I am not summoned?

00:36:22.513 --> 00:36:24.098
Cho Won, come forward!

00:36:33.441 --> 00:36:35.443
His Majesty orders you to read this.

00:37:22.990 --> 00:37:25.243
Another order of paper has just come in.

00:37:25.326 --> 00:37:26.869
We work through the night!

00:37:28.454 --> 00:37:29.580
Can I help you, sir?

00:37:30.373 --> 00:37:31.624
Who are you?

00:37:31.707 --> 00:37:35.044
Ah, I… I'm in the right place, at least.

00:38:04.907 --> 00:38:06.659
Take it easy now!

00:38:07.368 --> 00:38:10.705
At this pace, I doubt this paper
will be fit for sale come the morning.

00:38:10.788 --> 00:38:12.832
Damn you and your idle talking!

00:38:15.167 --> 00:38:17.420
Well, sir. What brings you here?

00:38:19.964 --> 00:38:21.340
In the last petition,

00:38:22.216 --> 00:38:24.093
you claimed your family was starving.

00:38:24.176 --> 00:38:26.721
Well, how have you been faring since?

00:38:26.804 --> 00:38:28.347
No better.

00:38:29.223 --> 00:38:30.766
Because of your petition,

00:38:31.350 --> 00:38:33.477
several officials have faced punishment.

00:38:34.312 --> 00:38:38.816
So, I came by to see if any of them
had tried getting revenge.

00:38:40.484 --> 00:38:43.279
Hmm…

00:38:48.576 --> 00:38:50.369
I received your confidential message

00:38:50.453 --> 00:38:52.621
and took the papermaker's words to heart.

00:38:53.622 --> 00:38:56.709
Therefore, I have commanded
for all those involved

00:38:57.209 --> 00:38:59.420
to be summoned to Hanyang at once.

00:38:59.503 --> 00:39:01.130
Forgive me, your grace,

00:39:01.213 --> 00:39:04.633
but it seems the matter concerns
more about papermaker Gil-san.

00:39:06.052 --> 00:39:07.386
I assumed as much.

00:39:08.137 --> 00:39:12.058
Corruption, by nature,
is wont to spread like wildfire.

00:39:13.768 --> 00:39:15.394
I humbly apologize, your grace.

00:39:15.478 --> 00:39:17.688
You have no need to apologize.

00:39:20.399 --> 00:39:22.568
-Left State Councilor.
-Yes, your grace?

00:39:26.155 --> 00:39:28.824
I shall entrust that man with a task.

00:39:30.618 --> 00:39:32.828
I humbly await Your Grace's command.

00:39:34.538 --> 00:39:36.957
I confide this to you in trust.

00:39:37.041 --> 00:39:39.502
What I have begun in Hwaseong

00:39:40.127 --> 00:39:44.799
is no less than an act of filial piety
to honor my late father.

00:39:45.383 --> 00:39:46.592
That is the reason

00:39:47.468 --> 00:39:49.887
I shall not tolerate
any form of injustice,

00:39:49.970 --> 00:39:51.597
no matter how trivial.

00:40:02.191 --> 00:40:03.609
My lord husband,

00:40:04.235 --> 00:40:06.779
what has caused you
to take up smoking again?

00:40:10.199 --> 00:40:11.450
This book…

00:40:12.451 --> 00:40:14.870
Cho Won wrote this book, did he not?

00:40:18.207 --> 00:40:19.375
The other day,

00:40:20.167 --> 00:40:22.628
when we briefly passed each other
on the road,

00:40:22.711 --> 00:40:27.383
I felt the faint smile on his lips
bore a trace of excessive lust.

00:40:27.883 --> 00:40:29.677
It was rather disturbing.

00:40:30.261 --> 00:40:35.307
Did you not say that Lord Cho Won
had fallen out of favor with the king?

00:40:36.684 --> 00:40:38.018
Hmm.

00:40:40.396 --> 00:40:41.397
It would seem…

00:40:43.399 --> 00:40:45.401
his fortunes will soon be
quite the opposite.

00:40:45.901 --> 00:40:48.237
So I have asked him
to be our guest here a while.

00:40:48.821 --> 00:40:51.157
That is all you need to know.

00:41:01.500 --> 00:41:02.918
This is all we need to pack?

00:41:03.752 --> 00:41:04.753
You rascal.

00:41:05.254 --> 00:41:06.755
You seemed almost pleased at that.

00:41:06.839 --> 00:41:08.507
It's just over there. We'll be fine.

00:41:09.008 --> 00:41:11.343
Are you leaving?

00:41:11.427 --> 00:41:12.720
Oh, my.

00:41:13.804 --> 00:41:15.639
Have you come to see me off, my lady?

00:41:17.766 --> 00:41:19.268
I am most humbly honored.

00:41:19.351 --> 00:41:21.103
You are talented indeed.

00:41:21.604 --> 00:41:23.647
Somehow, you got inside that house.

00:41:23.731 --> 00:41:26.358
The heavens must be lending a hand.

00:41:27.318 --> 00:41:28.319
Although,

00:41:28.402 --> 00:41:30.362
who is this assistance for?

00:41:31.113 --> 00:41:35.075
Could this blessing
be meant for you in the end?

00:41:36.035 --> 00:41:37.286
Or indeed for me?

00:41:39.788 --> 00:41:41.415
If I had to guess,

00:41:41.499 --> 00:41:44.502
I'd say your debauchery
was too much for heaven.

00:41:46.170 --> 00:41:47.838
Too much, you say?

00:41:48.881 --> 00:41:51.800
Well, now, when this little wager
of ours is over,

00:41:52.301 --> 00:41:55.679
you'll have to see for yourself, cousin.

00:41:56.805 --> 00:41:58.349
Until then.

00:42:11.987 --> 00:42:15.157
Madam, a messenger just delivered this.

00:42:15.241 --> 00:42:16.742
It's from the tobacco shop,

00:42:16.825 --> 00:42:19.411
but he said it was intended
for Lord Cho Won.

00:42:19.495 --> 00:42:20.788
Shall I go after him?

00:42:23.249 --> 00:42:25.084
Since it came from that shop,

00:42:25.167 --> 00:42:26.835
I assume it is tobacco.

00:42:28.754 --> 00:42:31.465
But that red silk vexes me greatly.

00:42:32.258 --> 00:42:35.010
I shall deliver it to him.
Take it to my chamber.

00:42:35.511 --> 00:42:36.512
Yes.

00:42:51.944 --> 00:42:53.862
You have no idea how excited I am.

00:42:54.738 --> 00:42:55.739
Right this way.

00:43:02.705 --> 00:43:04.206
This is the rear garden.

00:43:05.249 --> 00:43:07.084
Now that I have you in my house,

00:43:07.167 --> 00:43:09.253
you had best put away
any thought of escape.

00:43:09.795 --> 00:43:12.840
There are so many things
I wish to ask you, hear from you,

00:43:12.923 --> 00:43:14.466
and learn from you, of course.

00:43:20.222 --> 00:43:25.894
Oh, um, these quarters are where
my sister-in-law has been residing.

00:43:25.978 --> 00:43:29.189
Since my brother's passing,
she has been in mourning,

00:43:29.898 --> 00:43:31.567
but you know this from meeting her.

00:43:32.651 --> 00:43:33.819
A tragedy.

00:43:35.738 --> 00:43:36.822
Please follow me.